        "y0": 0.494242564596311,
        "x1": 0.8980716131871043,
        "y1": 0.5081818320534446
      },
      "text": "compared with the correlation coefficients between variables. In Table 3, for each variable, the square",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.5106061901709046,
        "x1": 0.8981451146742877,
        "y1": 0.5245454576280382
      },
      "text": "root of the AVE value was larger than the correlation coefficient values with any other variable,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.5269698157454982,
        "x1": 0.6362399680941713,
        "y1": 0.5409090832026318
      },
      "text": "thereby verifying the discriminant validity of this study (see Table 3).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16470588733947356,
        "y0": 0.5430304233473962,
        "x1": 0.8980169607922922,
        "y1": 0.5569696908045296
      },
      "text": "The results of analysis test obtained from variables measurement demonstrate that all of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.5593940489219897,
        "x1": 0.8980509689430786,
        "y1": 0.5733333163791232
      },
      "text": "variables in this research have outer loading above 0.50 (see Table  5). This means that all of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.5757577130288789,
        "x1": 0.8980794919082542,
        "y1": 0.5896969804860125
      },
      "text": "indicators, as a measurement of the construct, have been proven to have convergent  validity. The",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.5921213386034725,
        "x1": 0.8980841792486851,
        "y1": 0.6060606060606061
      },
      "text": "results of discriminant validity analysis test also show higher correlation between variables and each",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.6081819462053704,
        "x1": 0.8981469098259421,
        "y1": 0.622121213662504
      },
      "text": "of indicators than between variables and other indicators. This means that the model has met",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.624545571779964,
        "x1": 0.8982293870713975,
        "y1": 0.6384848392370975
      },
      "text": "discriminant validity. It can be concluded, therefore, that the evaluation of outer model has been",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.6409092358868531,
        "x1": 0.587220360251034,
        "y1": 0.6548485033439868
      },
      "text": "fulfilled so the next evaluation is the evaluation of inner model.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.6733334690633446,
        "x1": 0.39951224732243157,
        "y1": 0.6872727365204783
      },
      "text": "4.2. Structural Model (Inner Model)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16470588733947356,
        "y0": 0.6896970946379382,
        "x1": 0.8979943219353171,
        "y1": 0.7036363620950719
      },
      "text": "The structural model indicates the causal relationships among the latent constructs in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.7060607394786796,
        "x1": 0.898165260265076,
        "y1": 0.7200000069358132
      },
      "text": "research model. Assessment of structural model was done first by determining the predictive power of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.7221213470805775,
        "x1": 0.2257041681825725,
        "y1": 0.7360606145377111
      },
      "text": "the model and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.23490195180855544,
        "y0": 0.7221213470805775,
        "x1": 0.8939310460308798,
        "y1": 0.7360606145377111
      },
      "text": "second by analyzing the hypothesized relationships among the latent constructs",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.7384849726551711,
        "x1": 0.41805312212775736,
        "y1": 0.7524242401123047
      },
      "text": "proposed in the research model. The R²",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4239215726166769,
        "y0": 0.7384849726551711,
        "x1": 0.898088143541922,
        "y1": 0.7524242401123047
      },
      "text": "-values of the dependent variables determine the predictive",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.7548486174959125,
        "x1": 0.8980355106927211,
        "y1": 0.7687878849530461
      },
      "text": "power of the research model and the path coefficients evaluate the strength of the hypothesized",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.7712122430705061,
        "x1": 0.898083082211563,
        "y1": 0.7851515105276397
      },
      "text": "relationships. The  judgment of what R²  level  is high depends,  however, on  the  specific  research",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.7872728506724039,
        "x1": 0.8981382332596124,
        "y1": 0.8012121181295375
      },
      "text": "discipline. Whereas R²  results of 0.20 are considered high  in disciplines  such as  consumer behavior,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.8036364955131454,
        "x1": 0.8981252682754417,
        "y1": 0.8175757629702789
      },
      "text": "R² values of 0.75 would be perceived as  high in success driver studies. In marketing research studies,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.820000121087739,
        "x1": 0.8981694489522697,
        "y1": 0.8339393885448726
      },
      "text": "R² values of 0.75, 0.50, or 0.25 for endogenous  latent  variables in the structural model can, as a rule of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.8363637659284804,
        "x1": 0.8980880687439364,
        "y1": 0.850303033385614
      },
      "text": "thumb, be described as substantial, moderate, or weak, respectively (Hair et al., 2011). Following Chin",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.8524243735303783,
        "x1": 0.898082882750268,
        "y1": 0.8663636409875118
      },
      "text": "(2009), boots trap resampling method that uses randomly selected subsamples was employed to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.8687880087380457,
        "x1": 0.5922242457570593,
        "y1": 0.8827272761951793
      },
      "text": "estimate the theoretical model and hypothesized relationships.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16470588733947356,
        "y0": 0.8851516439457132,
        "x1": 0.6333472806643816,
        "y1": 0.8990909114028468
      },
      "text": "The results of analysis output are shown in Figure  1, the R²",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.638823515449474,
        "y0": 0.8851516439457132,
        "x1": 0.8980971193001941,
        "y1": 0.8990909114028468
      },
      "text": "-values, path coefficients, t-value",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10588235792770885,
        "y0": 0.9015154043833414,
        "x1": 0.8980714137258093,
        "y1": 0.915454671840475
      },
      "text": "and the significance values are presented in Table  6. As is evident from Figure  1, the model has high",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
